        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPS-330, Modern 3 Inch Square Furniture Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 Inch Square Ring Pull is great for adding a modern look to any lightweight door or drawer. It has a 2-5/16 inch cutout, making it perfect for big hands to get a comfortable grip or for heavier dresser drawers. It is available in 5 finishes, including polished brass, oil rubbed bronze, and satin nickel. The Modern 3 Inch Square Furniture Ring Pull is made with attention to quality out of solid brass, ensuring that it will continue to look stunning after years of use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Smaller <a href=\"/products/modern-2-inch-square-furniture-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rps-220\">2\" Square Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Square RPS330 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\" square</li>\r\n<li>Grip: 3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
